{{!
    @template tool_vae/note_lines

    The lines of annotations of one target: the sentence that no annotation validates, then either the sentence that there
    is none, or each line - a withdrawn one in grey with its signature, a standing one with its signature, its text and,
    for its author, the button to withdraw it.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\note_lines. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except these keys:
    * texthtml - the annotation, through format_text() (plain or Markdown, cleaned, no filter)
    * buttonhtml - the button to withdraw it, drawn by the renderer of the core ('' for none)

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * notvalidation - string, the sentence that no annotation validates
    * none - object or null: text, the sentence that there is no annotation
    * notes - array: class (the classes of the line), withdrawn (object: words, signature) or null, standing (object:
      signature, texthtml, buttonhtml) or null

    Example context (json):
    {
        "notvalidation": "An annotation validates nothing.",
        "none": null,
        "notes": [
            {
                "class": "tool-vae-note border-start ps-2 ms-3 mb-2",
                "withdrawn": null,
                "standing": {"signature": "By Nadia Benali, 21/11/2026", "texthtml": "<p>Well told.</p>", "buttonhtml": ""}
            },
            {
                "class": "tool-vae-note border-start ps-2 ms-3 mb-2 text-muted",
                "withdrawn": {"words": "Annotation withdrawn.", "signature": "By Nadia Benali, 20/11/2026"},
                "standing": null
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<p class="small text-muted">{{notvalidation}}</p>{{#none}}<p class="text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/none}}{{!
}}{{#notes}}<div class="{{class}}">{{!
}}{{#withdrawn}}<div class="small text-muted">{{words}} {{signature}}</div>{{/withdrawn}}{{!
}}{{#standing}}<div class="small">{{signature}}</div><div>{{{texthtml}}}</div>{{{buttonhtml}}}{{/standing}}{{!
}}</div>{{/notes}}
